          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "### Your dock, your way\nMaxDock gives you three ways to browse the Home Screen dock:\n\n- **Normal** keeps a single row with a configurable magnification effect.\n- **Circular** lets you swipe through a rotating dock.\n- **Swipe Loop** scrolls horizontally and wraps back to the first app.\n\nAdjust the icon size, capacity, dock position and glass appearance in **Settings → MaxDock**. Choose a preset for Gaming, Compact, or macOS, or set the controls yourself.\n\n**Rootless beta.** iOS 16 is the tested baseline. Support on other versions allowed by the package is experimental."
